From 08b9ff4e56b54a97f69ef36fbd851c77916a8751 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: native-host draft <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 01:35:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Expose the remote transceiver MID and
 RTCIceConnectionState

PeerConnectionObserver gains on_track_with_mid, so hosts can join several
same-kind remote tracks to their SDP mapping instead of by arrival order,
and on_ice_connection_state_change, so a host can tell an ICE failure from
a DTLS/transport failure. Both are additive; on_track is unchanged.

Draft for review; not proposed upstream from this session.
